# Locus of Enlightenment crafted with two Goblin Bombardments (and Walking Ballista and Mox Ruby) has the Bombardment's
# ability twice (CR 702.167c, 113.2c), each instance "only once each turn" (CR 602.5b): on turn 13 Bot1 activates it twice,
# sacrificing an Ornithopter each time, and the third time is refused with a third Ornithopter to sacrifice. Locus's
# trigger copies each activation; the copies were not activated (CR 707.10) and use up nothing: Bot2 takes 4. The
# Ballista's "{4}: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature" puts its counter on Locus, whose ability it now is (the ruling: an
# ability that names its card means Locus; CR 113.7), and its copy another: two counters.

